<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>记忆时间与初值 · 视频看板</title>
<style>
:root{color-scheme:light;--bg:#f4f6f6;--ink:#26343d;--muted:#677781;--line:#dce3e5;--teal:#63B8C6;--rose:#E8A0A6;--purple:#8C6BB1}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:14px/1.55 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif}main{max-width:1320px;margin:auto;padding:26px 24px 50px}.eyebrow{letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}h1{font-size:28px;font-weight:620;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:5px 0 7px}p{margin:5px 0;color:var(--muted)}.intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:19px}.count{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:white;padding:10px 18px;color:var(--muted);text-align:right;white-space:nowrap}.count strong{font-size:22px;color:var(--ink);display:block}header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:4;padding:13px 16px;background:#fdfefef5;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;backdrop-filter:blur(12px);box-shadow:0 5px 20px #24394108}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:5px 0}.label{color:var(--muted);min-width:70px}.spacer{flex:1}button,select{font:inherit;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px;background:white;color:var(--ink);padding:6px 10px;cursor:pointer}button:hover,select:hover{border-color:#82aeb7}button[aria-pressed=true]{background:#e4f1f3;border-color:#8ec6ce}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:default}button:focus-visible,input:focus-visible,select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--purple);outline-offset:2px}#play{background:#263c44;color:white;min-width:72px}#seek{flex:1;min-width:170px;accent-color:#478a97}#clock{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;min-width:180px}#phase{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}#notice{min-height:18px;font-size:12px;color:#956844;margin-top:5px}.guide{font-size:12px;margin:13px 2px 4px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:16px;margin-top:16px}.grid.large{grid-template-columns:1fr}article{border:1px solid var(--line);border-top:3px solid var(--case);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:white}article .cap{padding:10px 12px 8px;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}h2{font-size:16px;margin:0;font-weight:600}.tag{font-size:11px;border-radius:4px;padding:2px 6px;background:#f0ece5;color:#8a6340}.live{margin-left:auto;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}video{display:block;width:100%;aspect-ratio:536/190;background:#101318}.numbers{padding:9px 12px;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.numbers b{font-weight:500;color:var(--ink)}.plotbox{margin-top:22px;background:white;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:16px}svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.plotbox h2{font-size:15px}.small{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}details{margin-top:20px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:14px}summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--ink)}table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:12px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;margin:10px 0}td,th{padding:7px 9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);text-align:right}td:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left}.tablewrap{overflow:auto}a{color:#467e8b;text-underline-offset:3px}.empty{text-align:center;padding:50px;color:var(--muted)}.error{color:#a7484a!important}@media(max-width:760px){main{padding:16px 10px}.intro{display:block}.count{display:none}h1{font-size:25px}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}header{padding:9px}.label{min-width:56px}.spacer{display:none}#clock{min-width:145px;font-size:12px}}
</style></head><body><main>
<div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">WET ACTIVE NEMATIC / MEMORY SCAN</div><h1>记忆时间与初值</h1><p>mc = 0.2287 · τχ ≈ 0.3 τc · 256 × 256 · 四种初始化 · 两个种子</p></div><div class="count"><strong>160 / 160</strong>模拟与视频齐全</div></div>
<header>
<div class="row"><label class="label" for="tm">τm / τc</label><button id="prev" aria-label="前一个记忆时间">‹</button><select id="tm" aria-label="记忆时间"></select><button id="next" aria-label="后一个记忆时间">›</button><span id="presets"></span><span class="spacer"></span><label for="seed">种子</label><select id="seed"><option value="1">1</option><option value="2">2</option><option value="both">两者</option></select><button id="size" aria-pressed="false">大画面</button></div>
<div class="row" id="starts"><span class="label">初始化</span></div>
<div class="row"><label class="label" for="window">时间窗口</label><select id="window"><option value="full">全过程（含准备）</option><option value="post" selected>反馈后</option><option value="tail">末 500 τc</option></select><button id="play">播放</button><button id="reset">窗口起点</button><input id="seek" type="range" min="0" max="1" step="1" value="0" aria-label="模拟帧"><span id="clock">t / τc = —</span><select id="speed" aria-label="播放速度"><option value="0.5">0.5×</option><option value="1" selected>1×</option><option value="2">2×</option><option value="4">4×</option><option value="8">8×</option></select></div>
<div class="row small"><span id="phase"></span><span class="spacer"></span><span id="selection"></span></div>
<div id="notice" role="status">页面脚本尚未启动。请用浏览器打开此 index.html。</div>
</header>
<p class="guide">每张卡片从左至右为 |u|、P、m、χ，所有案例色标相同。χ 蓝色对应 high activity，红色对应 low activity。t = 0 为反馈释放；负时间为准备阶段。</p>
<div id="cards" class="grid"></div>
<section class="plotbox"><h2>所选轨迹 · 全场平均 χ</h2><p class="small">曲线取自完整网格统计；虚线为当前视频时刻。点击曲线区域可跳转。</p><svg id="trace" viewBox="0 0 1000 200" role="img" aria-label="所选初始化的平均chi随时间变化"></svg></section>
<details><summary>末态统计与诊断</summary><p class="small">末态取最后 500 τc；stdₜ 是 χ̄(t) 的时间标准差。诊断标记保留原分析结果，模拟成功不等于所有收敛检查均通过。</p><div class="tablewrap" id="table"></div></details>
<details><summary>初始化、时间与画面说明</summary><p>全 0 的 m₀ = 0.3301；全 1 的 m₀ = 0.0559。对半初始化左侧 χ = 0、右侧 χ = 1，m₀ 分别匹配这两个值。Noise 为均值 0.5、标准差 0.1、平滑长度 7.02 的相关 Gaussian 场，截断到 [0,1]，m₀ = 0.2503。</p><p>准备阶段为 100–180 τc：冻结 χ 反应，保留输运与扩散。对半和 noise 指模拟启动时的初始化，在页面时间轴上位于负时间。反馈释放时已发生混合；卡片列出了实际释放时的 χ 均值和空间标准差。</p><p>每帧间隔 337 steps ≈ 0.499756 τc，25 fps；1× 每秒经过约 12.49 τc。视频保留全部存储帧，窗口切换只改变播放区间。反馈释放一般不落在采样时刻，时间标签使用真实存储步数，末帧略早于 2000 τc。</p><p>原模拟为 256×256；视频经过 8×8 空间平均，真实分辨率为 32×32，放大采用 nearest neighbour。|u| 流只保存速度模长，不能重建流线。实时 χ̄、m̄ 均来自完整网格统计，不从量化像素计算。</p><p>本页面及 MP4 均为本地文件，无外部脚本或网络依赖。移动文件时请保留整个 dashboard 文件夹；可直接打开 index.html，无需服务器。</p></details>
</main><script type="application/json" id="data">__DATA__</script><script>
(()=>{'use strict';const $=id=>document.getElementById(id);try{
const data=JSON.parse($('data').textContent),runs=data.runs,tc=data.tau_c;
const labels={'0':'全 0','1':'全 1',stripe01:'左 0 / 右 1',noise:'Gaussian noise'},colors={'0':'#63B8C6','1':'#E8A0A6',stripe01:'#8C6BB1',noise:'#596879'};
const flagNames={terminal_drift:'末段漂移',terminal_block_variation:'末段波动',preparation_drift:'准备阶段漂移',incomplete_output:'输出不完整',visits_both_phases:'跨越两相',flow_not_developed:'流动未充分发展'};
const grid=[...new Set(runs.map(r=>r.tm_over_tc))].sort((a,b)=>a-b),chosen=new Set(Object.keys(labels));
let ti=9,entries=[],playing=false,rate=1,index=0,first=0,last=0,master=null,timer=null,large=false;
const fmt=x=>Math.abs(x)<.001&&x!==0?x.toExponential(2):x.toFixed(4),timeOf=(r,i)=>(i*r.frame_steps-r.preparation_steps)/tc;
const selected=()=>runs.filter(r=>r.tm_over_tc===grid[ti]&&chosen.has(r.initialization)&&($('seed').value==='both'||r.replicate===+$('seed').value)).sort((a,b)=>Object.keys(labels).indexOf(a.initialization)-Object.keys(labels).indexOf(b.initialization)||a.replicate-b.replicate);
function frameRange(r,mode){let a=0;if(mode==='post')a=Math.ceil(r.preparation_steps/r.frame_steps);if(mode==='tail')a=Math.ceil((r.nsteps-500*tc)/r.frame_steps);return [a,r.frames-1]}
function report(message,isError=false){$('notice').textContent=message;$('notice').classList.toggle('error',isError)}
function stop(){playing=false;$('play').textContent='播放';for(const e of entries)e.v.pause()}
function stamp(){const r=entries[0]?.r;if(!r)return;index=Math.max(first,Math.min(last,index));$('seek').value=index;const t=timeOf(r,index);$('clock').textContent=`t / τc = ${t.toFixed(2)}`;$('phase').textContent=t<0?'准备阶段 · χ 反应冻结':'反馈释放后';for(const e of entries)e.live.textContent=`χ̄ ${fmt(e.r.chi[index])} · m̄ ${fmt(e.r.memory[index])}`;const cursor=$('cursor');if(cursor){const x=55+925*(index-first)/Math.max(1,last-first);cursor.setAttribute('x1',x);cursor.setAttribute('x2',x)}}
function seekTo(i){index=Math.round(Math.max(first,Math.min(last,i)));for(const e of entries){e.target=index/e.r.fps;if(e.v.readyState>=1)e.v.currentTime=e.target}stamp()}
function play(){if(!entries.length)return;if(index>=last)seekTo(first);playing=true;$('play').textContent='暂停';report('');for(const e of entries){e.v.playbackRate=rate;e.v.play().catch(err=>{stop();report('播放未能启动：'+err.message+'。请再次点击播放。',true)})}}
function trace(){const r=entries[0]?.r,svg=$('trace');if(!r){svg.replaceChildren();return}let text='';for(const y of [0,.5,1]){const yy=166-y*145;text+=`<line x1="55" y1="${yy}" x2="980" y2="${yy}" stroke="#e7ecee"/><text x="42" y="${yy+4}" text-anchor="end" fill="#677781" font-size="11">${y}</text>`}for(let k=0;k<=4;k++){const i=first+(last-first)*k/4,x=55+925*k/4;text+=`<text x="${x}" y="190" text-anchor="middle" fill="#677781" font-size="11">${timeOf(r,i).toFixed(0)}</text>`}for(const e of entries){let points=[],step=Math.max(1,Math.floor((last-first)/500));for(let i=first;i<=last;i+=step)points.push(`${55+925*(i-first)/Math.max(1,last-first)},${166-e.r.chi[i]*145}`);points.push(`980,${166-e.r.chi[last]*145}`);text+=`<polyline points="${points.join(' ')}" fill="none" stroke="${colors[e.r.initialization]}" stroke-width="1.8" ${e.r.replicate===2?'stroke-dasharray="5 3"':''}/>`}text+='<line id="cursor" x1="55" x2="55" y1="16" y2="169" stroke="#43535e" stroke-dasharray="4 4"/>';svg.innerHTML=text;stamp()}
function setWindow(reset=true){if(!entries.length)return;[first,last]=frameRange(entries[0].r,$('window').value);$('seek').min=first;$('seek').max=last;seekTo(reset?first:index);trace()}
function drawTable(){const rr=selected();$('table').innerHTML='<table><thead><tr><th>初始化</th><th>种子</th><th>末态 χ̄</th><th>stdₜ</th><th>drift</th><th>诊断</th></tr></thead><tbody>'+rr.map(r=>`<tr><td>${labels[r.initialization]}</td><td>${r.replicate}</td><td>${fmt(r.tail_mean)}</td><td>${fmt(r.tail_std_time)}</td><td>${fmt(r.tail_half_drift)}</td><td>${r.diagnostic_flags.map(f=>flagNames[f]||f).join('、')||'通过'}</td></tr>`).join('')+'</tbody></table>'}
function render(){const old=entries[0]?.r,oldTime=old?timeOf(old,index):0;stop();master=null;for(const e of entries){e.v.removeAttribute('src');e.v.load()}entries=[];$('cards').replaceChildren();report('');
 for(const r of selected()){const card=document.createElement('article');card.style.setProperty('--case',colors[r.initialization]);const flags=r.diagnostic_flags.map(f=>flagNames[f]||f);card.innerHTML=`<div class="cap"><h2>${labels[r.initialization]} <span class="small">· 种子 ${r.replicate}</span></h2>${flags.length?`<span class="tag" title="${flags.join('、')}">需留意 · ${flags.join('、')}</span>`:''}<span class="live"></span></div><div class="numbers"><span>末态 χ̄ <b>${fmt(r.tail_mean)}</b></span><span>释放时 χ̄ <b>${fmt(r.release_chi_mean)}</b></span><span>释放时空间 std <b>${fmt(r.release_chi_std)}</b></span></div>`;const v=document.createElement('video');v.muted=true;v.playsInline=true;v.controls=true;v.preload='auto';v.src=r.url;v.setAttribute('aria-label',`${labels[r.initialization]} 种子${r.replicate}：速度、压力、memory、chi`);card.insertBefore(v,card.lastElementChild);$('cards').append(card);const e={r,v,live:card.querySelector('.live'),target:null};entries.push(e);
 v.addEventListener('loadedmetadata',()=>{if(!entries.includes(e))return;if(Math.abs(v.duration-r.duration)>.1){report('视频长度与记录不符：'+r.case,true);return}v.currentTime=index/r.fps;e.target=index/r.fps;v.playbackRate=rate;stamp()});
 v.addEventListener('error',()=>{if(entries.includes(e))report('无法载入视频：'+r.case+'。请检查 downloads 文件夹是否随 index.html 一起保留。',true)});
 v.addEventListener('play',()=>{if(!entries.includes(e))return;if(!playing){master=e;index=Math.round(v.currentTime*r.fps);seekTo(index);play()}});
 v.addEventListener('pause',()=>{if(playing&&entries.includes(e)&&!v.ended)stop()});
 v.addEventListener('seeked',()=>{if(!entries.includes(e))return;if(e.target!==null&&Math.abs(v.currentTime-e.target)<.08){e.target=null;return}master=e;seekTo(Math.round(v.currentTime*r.fps))});
 }
 master=entries[0]||null;if(entries.length){[first,last]=frameRange(entries[0].r,$('window').value);index=Math.round((oldTime*tc+entries[0].r.preparation_steps)/entries[0].r.frame_steps);setWindow(!old)}else{$('cards').innerHTML='<div class="empty">选择至少一种初始化来查看视频。</div>';$('trace').replaceChildren()}
 $('play').disabled=!entries.length;$('tm').value=ti;$('prev').disabled=ti===0;$('next').disabled=ti===grid.length-1;$('selection').textContent=`τm/τc = ${grid[ti].toFixed(6)} · ${entries.length} 路同步视频`;
 document.querySelectorAll('[data-start]').forEach(b=>b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',chosen.has(b.dataset.start)));drawTable();
}
grid.forEach((x,i)=>{const o=document.createElement('option');o.value=i;o.textContent=x.toFixed(3);$('tm').append(o)});
for(const [key,label] of Object.entries(labels)){const b=document.createElement('button');b.dataset.start=key;b.textContent=label;b.onclick=()=>{chosen.has(key)?chosen.delete(key):chosen.add(key);render()};$('starts').append(b)}
for(const i of [0,7,8,9,19]){const b=document.createElement('button');b.textContent=grid[i].toFixed(2);b.title='切换 τm/τc';b.onclick=()=>{ti=i;render()};$('presets').append(b)}
$('tm').onchange=()=>{ti=+$('tm').value;render()};$('prev').onclick=()=>{ti=Math.max(0,ti-1);render()};$('next').onclick=()=>{ti=Math.min(grid.length-1,ti+1);render()};$('seed').onchange=render;
$('play').onclick=()=>playing?stop():play();$('reset').onclick=()=>seekTo(first);$('seek').oninput=()=>seekTo(+$('seek').value);$('window').onchange=()=>{stop();setWindow(true)};
$('speed').onchange=()=>{rate=+$('speed').value;for(const e of entries)e.v.playbackRate=rate};$('size').onclick=()=>{large=!large;$('cards').classList.toggle('large',large);$('size').setAttribute('aria-pressed',large)};
$('trace').onclick=event=>{const box=$('trace').getBoundingClientRect(),x=(event.clientX-box.left)/box.width*1000;seekTo(first+(last-first)*(x-55)/925)};
timer=setInterval(()=>{if(!playing||!master||master.v.readyState<2)return;index=Math.min(last,Math.floor(master.v.currentTime*master.r.fps));if(index>=last){stop();seekTo(last);return}const target=index/master.r.fps;for(const e of entries)if(e!==master&&e.v.readyState>=2&&!e.v.seeking&&Math.abs(e.v.currentTime-target)>.16){e.target=target;e.v.currentTime=target}stamp()},100);
window.addEventListener('pagehide',()=>{stop();clearInterval(timer)});render();
}catch(error){$('notice').classList.add('error');$('notice').textContent='页面初始化失败：'+error.message;console.error(error)}})();
</script></body></html>
